]We ended up[ going to another last minute] event, the Tompkins Square dog parade, so Smiley wore his same avocadog costume and[ got] outshined by popes and other crazy intricate creative costumes! It was a lot of fun and we’[re definitely] going again next year with a better costume. Although most dogs wore hot dogs, delivery costumes and they rocked them, as a[ cra]fter I got inspired to do something a little more creative!
